s=['# Color reference','', 'Web primary scales and semantic aliases match the supplied October JSON. Secondary ramps are supplied brand colors for supporting use. Conflicting PDF neutral ramps are recorded in docs/source-audit.md. Illustration colors retain earlier observed values. The package retains exact source HEX values rather than generating interpolated shades.','']
